  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.4.0: webhook endpoints per channel plus event handlers. New: the generic MapLineWebhook and AddLineWebhookHandler dispatch events to a LineWebhookHandler subclass; LineWebhookEndpointOptions.ChannelName and ChannelRouteParameter (mutually exclusive) select the channel, verify the signature with that channel secret and answer 401 for an unknown channel before anything is touched, exposing the verified name in HttpContext.Items[LineWebhookItems.ChannelName]; LineWebhookEndpointOptions.Maintenance answers non-administrators with a maintenance text instead of reaching the handler or auto reply, and ErrorNotification pushes a note to the administrators when a handler throws, never changing the 200. Auto reply, the maintenance reply and error notification use the channel the event arrived on, and the whole-payload MapLineWebhook overload accepts LineWebhookEndpointOptions. Without a channel option the endpoint behaves exactly as before. See https://github.com/ozakboy/Ozakboy.Line/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
